{"ID":"20240513083201-u88g259","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083201-u88g259","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083201-u88g259\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513150821-3vmkq6m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513150821-3vmkq6m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:926,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513150821-3vmkq6m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:937,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:937\u0026#125;","title":"178","type":"doc","updated":"20240515122530"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513150821-3vmkq6m","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1009px;","id":"20240513150821-3vmkq6m","updated":"20240515122530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期： 2008/05/05"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"155-3 B, S"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1975(33) / 中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/05"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 右乳時抽痛。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→女子胸為陽，男子腹為陽。 胸部偶作痛為陽不足，補陽即可"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 胃中時如有水感。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 右眼時癢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 月經來第一天較悶痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 近來累時久站或言語皆會喘。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→因腎臟管心氣，肺臟管土氣， 久立傷腎，此為“喘”因。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1. 月經："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有時會遲一點 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2. 睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3. 大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不規則。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4. 汗："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平時不流汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5. 噁心欲吐："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6. 小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7. 手足溫度："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8. 口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有，溫水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9. 胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10.精神："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"易倦怠。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11. 其他："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"飯後不消化，喝湯加重。 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→胃寒，寒是水。吃東西下去後胃開始蠕動，蠕動消化時水就開 始動，喝湯水會增加更多而更不適。此為吳茱萸乾薑症。  "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無前額頭痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈緩無力；右脈很細小，左脈稍大於右脈。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡紅；牙痕一點點"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎區--較大 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→腎陽無法束，腎較一般人大，功能退化→補腎陽→為幼時施打疫苗過多所致"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"--瞳孔反應很好 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區--圈紋有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→脂肪肝→疏肝氣"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手涼額溫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 腎陽不足 胃中停水"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方：  無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吳茱萸三錢  乾薑二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→可將胃熱起來，排除胃中之水，乾薑除可去肺寒，胃寒亦可用之"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白朮五錢  茯苓六錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→專門對中焦停水，將濕由小便排出"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳皮三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 開胃氣"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"厚朴二錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 行氣"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"熟地二錢    澤瀉五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"敗龜板三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 純補腎陰 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" → 補腎陽 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如同充電    敗龜板滋陰，將電瓶水充起來，巴戟天補陽以蓄電"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女子胸部偶作痛為陽不足，補陽即可。一補陽陰會自回。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生半夏三錢  生薑二片"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→與制半夏不同，制半夏為熟品，（生半夏 生姜）為小半夏湯，生半夏可利水，將胃中之水排除。生薑色黃，可以刺激胃氣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當歸二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→此女大便不規則是血虛，用當歸仁劑輕推之"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡蠣五錢   炒麥芽五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→視用藥攻後胸是否仍痛或更痛，用“攻”可看“病”在哪裡，身體狀況如何"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"貳付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.疾病由陰虛"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 陽虛 "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 陰實"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治療時當由陰實"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陽虛 表病情好轉；陽虛"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陰虛 則病人幾乎恢復正常。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.當腎陽虛時應及時將腎陽補好，如此便不會產生陰實，腎臟不會發生病變。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.女子懷孕生子後，坐月子期間將身體補好則百病去，頭髮、聽力、骨皆變好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}